7&amp;k=Hg0RpVVI" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" title="QQ群" class="project__link_RRby">QQ群<span class="link--inset" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div><div class="col col--4 margin-vert--sm"><div class="project_D5mJ"><svg class="margin-right--md" style="height:1.25rem;width:1.25rem" fill="currentColor" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path d="M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30.214 12.67 47.431 13.319-28.264-18.843-46.781-51.005-46.781-87.391 0-19.492 5.197-37.36 14.294-52.954 51.655 63.675 129.3 105.258 216.365 109.807-1.624-7.797-2.599-15.918-2.599-24.04 0-57.828 46.782-104.934 104.934-104.934 30.213 0 57.502 12.67 76.67 33.137 23.715-4.548 46.456-13.32 66.599-25.34-7.798 24.366-24.366 44.833-46.132 57.827 21.117-2.273 41.584-8.122 60.426-16.243-14.292 20.791-32.161 39.308-52.628 54.253z"></path></svg><a href="https://twitter.com/kaosu_sensei" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" title="Twitter" class="project__link_RRby">Twitter<span class="link--inset" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div></div></div><section class="padding-vert--xl container wow fadeIn slow"><div class="row row--no-gutters shadow--md item_lBMD"><div class="col col--6" aria-hidden="true" style="background-image:url(&#x27;/images/background/rocket.avif&#x27;);background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center"></div><div class="col col--6 item__inner_Wy3_"><div><h1 class="margin-bottom--md item__title_jYBY">还原原作剧情</h1><p class="margin-bottom--md">我们会在一个游戏中致力于还原所有kirara系列漫画的剧情. 比如您可以上午与智乃看店，下午与芝麻凛露营. 我们会在保证游玩体验的情况下还原剧情，并且添加原创剧情来让两个剧情平滑过渡.</p><a class="button button--secondary" href="/docs/features/run-tasks">查看剧情系统</a></div></div></div></section><section class="padding-vert--xl container wow fadeIn slow"><div class="row row--no-gutters shadow--md item_MW0I"><div class="col col--6 item__inner_c3uH"><div><h1 class="margin-bottom--md">多样化游玩系统</h1><p class="margin-bottom--md">我们不仅仅开发主系统，我们还会开发音游系统/钓鱼系统/工作系统/露营系统/烹饪系统等等 来配合剧情需要与增加游玩乐趣. 并且让玩家怀有花一款游戏的钱买到了几款游戏一样的心情</p><a class="button button--secondary" href="/docs/features/version-and-publish">系统详细</a></div></div><div class="col col--6" aria-hidden="true" style="background-image:url(&#x27;/images/background/parcel.avif&#x27;);background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right"></div></div></section><section class="padding-vert--xl container"><div class="row margin-bottom--xl wow fadeInLeft slow"><div class="col col--8"><div><h1 class="margin-bottom--lg hero__title_vuYh">什么是芳文狂想曲?</h1><p class="margin-bottom--md hero__text_kvFJ">芳文幻想曲是一个2D RPG轻百日常类游戏，使用unity制作，以芳文社漫画为主的一个同人游戏 此游戏制作初心就是希望以开放世界来连接kirara系列漫画的所有世界 并且让玩家体验到漫画中的剧情与情节 还原各个场景/角色/工作/功能/剧情</p><p class="margin-bottom--md hero__text_kvFJ">我们是为爱发电的团队，并且十分缺人，如果您愿意贡献您的力量，您可以去往<!-- --> <a href="/join">加入我们页面</a>, 我们十分希望有小伙伴能加入我们来加速开发速度！</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col col--4 wow fadeIn slow"><div class="margin-top--xl card shadow--lw callout_vPQb"><div class="card__header"><h3 class="callout__title_CqL5"><svg class="callout__icon_myIL" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" data-prefix="fab" data-icon="unity" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" data-fa-i2svg=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M243.583 91.6027L323.695 138.384C326.575 140.026 326.68 144.583 323.695 146.225L228.503 201.854C225.623 203.55 222.22 203.444 219.549 201.854L124.357 146.225C121.425 144.636 121.373 139.973 124.357 138.384L204.417 91.6027V0L0 119.417V358.252L78.3843 312.477V218.914C78.3319 215.576 82.2066 213.192 85.0865 214.993L180.279 270.622C183.159 272.318 184.782 275.338 18